title: For other owners
pid: 3f2942cf-fb1d-4761-a96e-3d9afce8e3cf
body: |2-
  The save path ('server/from_text.rs', the call after the foreign
  policy) is Terry's; he should read c5d10a65. For Drew: an overrider
  drawn in the unread list draws its own subscribee folder with its
  original's chain of containers, several lines of noise per replied
  message; and a fresh view of a fork still draws its subscribee with a
  count and no children.
